  "summary": "C5 loads the region (60x60 cells, 54.18-55.36N, 13.26-14.44E) for 1991-12-27..2003-01-05 and 2014-06-01..08-31. C6 then builds \u00b15-day per-doy 90th-percentile pools, applies the 31-day wrap-around smoothing, and compares target SST to the smoothed threshold at doy 153-244. Those thresholds need raw doys 138-259, whose pools span May 12-Sep 20 of each baseline year. The per-cell run detection over all sea cells writes the mask; climatology and event lists do not feed it."
